    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[9]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Hey! Saw your comment about Lost Cause.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[9]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: Oh, hi!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[9]._dialogues.Array.data[2]._content
      value: Finally someone who understands how good that book is.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[9]._dialogues.Array.data[3]._content
      value: RIGHT?? Nobody I know has even read it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[9]._dialogues.Array.data[4]._content
      value: The ending was actually insane.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[9]._dialogues.Array.data[5]._content
      value: Don't even get me started.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[9]._dialogues.Array.data[6]._content
      value: So what about you? Tell me about yourself.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
