    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[20]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: I noticed you don't post much. You should! Your profile is cute.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[20]._dialogues.Array.data[2]._content
      value: Girl, you need to get out there. People need to know you exist.
