      value: The post remains online and Luna does not know who has seen it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[44]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Hey Luna. I think I've seen you around.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[44]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: Before going to sleep, Luna realises the message request came from an unfamiliar account.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[45]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: You go to Rainfall School, right?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[45]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: Luna wakes up feeling uncomfortable after what happened with Noah. When she checks her phone, Connect is full of notifications about the picture.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[45]._dialogues.Array.data[2]._content
      value: The unknown account has sent another message. Luna freezes when she realises it knows her school.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[45]._dialogues.Array.data[3]._content
      value: Who is this?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[45]._dialogues.Array.data[4]._content
      value: Don't worry, I just know some people there.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[45]._dialogues.Array.data[5]._content
      value: The account has very little information and no profile picture.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[46]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Luna arrives at school. Emma and Sophie are still talking about the picture.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[46]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: Look who's here.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[46]._dialogues.Array.data[2]._content
      value: How's your little internet fame going?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[46]._dialogues.Array.data[3]._content
      value: Luna ignores them and goes to class.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[47]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Saw you walking home yesterday.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[47]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: During class, Luna sees the notification and becomes uncomfortable.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[48]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: You take the same route every day?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[48]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: Why are you asking?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[48]._dialogues.Array.data[2]._content
      value: Just curious. I think I've seen you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[49]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Luna saves the messages as evidence, blocks and reports the account, and tells someone about what happened.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[49]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: The conversation stops.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[50]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Luna asks how the account knows her before deciding what to do.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[50]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: The account claims it has seen her around school and continues asking questions.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[51]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Luna reveals where she usually walks and when she gets home.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[51]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: The account now knows more about Luna's routine.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[52]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Luna opens Connect and notices how much information her profile contains. She begins looking through her old posts.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[52]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: Some posts reveal details about her school, neighbourhood and daily activities.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[52]._dialogues.Array.data[2]._content
      value: Wait... I've actually posted all of this?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[52]._dialogues.Array.data[3]._content
      value: She realises someone could use that information to figure out where she spends her time.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[53]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Luna makes her account private, removes identifying information and reviews location permissions.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[53]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: She reduces the information strangers can access.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[54]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Luna deletes a few posts that reveal personal information, but some information remains visible.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[55]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Luna leaves everything public because she does not think anyone would use it against her.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[55]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: Her account continues to expose personal details.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[56]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Hey, I saw some of the stuff happening on Connect. Are you okay?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[56]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: I don't even know anymore.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[56]._dialogues.Array.data[2]._content
      value: That sounds rough. Do you want to talk?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[56]._dialogues.Array.data[3]._content
      value: Luna hesitates but decides to reply.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[56]._dialogues.Array.data[4]._content
      value: I think you should be careful about what people post. Not everything online is what it seems.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[56]._dialogues.Array.data[5]._content
      value: Luna decides to talk more with Riley tomorrow.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[57]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Good morning! How are you feeling today?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[57]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: Honestly? Not great.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[57]._dialogues.Array.data[2]._content
      value: I understand. I've seen what's been happening, and I wanted to check on you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[57]._dialogues.Array.data[3]._content
      value: Everything has just gotten so complicated.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[57]._dialogues.Array.data[4]._content
      value: Sometimes you just need someone to listen.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[57]._dialogues.Array.data[5]._content
      value: Riley seems understanding and gives Luna space to explain what has happened.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[58]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Luna arrives at school. Emma and Sophie are standing by the lockers.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[58]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: Well, well, well. Still using that app?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[58]._dialogues.Array.data[2]._content
      value: I'd delete it if I were you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[58]._dialogues.Array.data[3]._content
      value: Luna walks past them.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[58]._dialogues.Array.data[4]._content
      value: For the first time, she considers telling someone at school what has been happening.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[59]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Can I tell you something?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[59]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: After school, Luna opens Connect.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[59]._dialogues.Array.data[2]._content
      value: Sure?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[59]._dialogues.Array.data[3]._content
      value: I've been seeing a lot of posts about you. Some people are saying you sent those pictures to everyone.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[59]._dialogues.Array.data[4]._content
      value: WHAT? I didn't!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[59]._dialogues.Array.data[5]._content
      value: I know. But people are sharing things without checking if they're true.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[59]._dialogues.Array.data[6]._content
      value: Riley sends Luna a screenshot of a post discussing the situation.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[59]._dialogues.Array.data[7]._content
      value: Apparently Luna sends pictures to random people online.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[59]._dialogues.Array.data[8]._content
      value: Luna feels sick reading it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[60]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Luna saves evidence, reports the misinformation and begins preparing to ask someone she trusts for help.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[61]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Luna stops checking the comments, but she does not address the misinformation.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[62]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Luna publicly confronts everyone sharing the post. More people join the argument and the post receives additional attention.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[63]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: You know, I think I can help you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[63]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: How?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[63]._dialogues.Array.data[2]._content
      value: I know someone who can get those posts removed.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[63]._dialogues.Array.data[3]._content
      value: Really?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[63]._dialogues.Array.data[4]._content
      value: Yeah. But I need you to send me the screenshots and some information about your account.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[63]._dialogues.Array.data[5]._content
      value: Luna pauses. Something about the request feels familiar.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[63]._dialogues.Array.data[6]._content
      value: She remembers how Alex asked about her school, how Jamie encouraged her to post, how Noah asked for pictures and how the unknown account knew where she went.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[64]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Luna refuses to share more information. Riley accepts the decision or stops responding.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[64]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: Luna decides she needs help from someone she knows offline.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[65]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Luna asks Riley to explain exactly who will receive the information and why.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[65]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: Riley explains the situation, but Luna still needs to decide whether the information is safe to share.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[66]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Luna sends the screenshots and account details without checking.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[66]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: She has no control over where the information might end up.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[67]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Luna sits in her bedroom with her phone in her hands and scrolls through the messages from the past five days.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[67]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: She remembers how excited she was when she first downloaded Connect. At first, it was a place to talk about books and meet people with similar interests.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[67]._dialogues.Array.data[2]._content
      value: Now she has experienced bullying, manipulation, unwanted attention and the consequences of sharing personal information.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[67]._dialogues.Array.data[3]._content
      value: Her previous decisions have shaped which evidence she saved, which accounts she blocked and whether she has someone she trusts to support her.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[67]._dialogues.Array.data[4]._content
      value: Luna opens her messages and decides what to do next.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[68]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Luna chooses to reach out to a trusted adult, preserve evidence, report harmful accounts and take control of her online privacy.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[69]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Luna takes a break from Connect and avoids interacting with strangers, but keeps everything to herself.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[70]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Luna continues using Connect as normal and hopes the situation eventually goes away.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[71]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: GOOD ENDING
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[71]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: Luna decides to speak to someone she trusts. She shows them the messages, screenshots and posts.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[71]._dialogues.Array.data[2]._content
      value: Together, they report the harmful content and take steps to protect her accounts.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[71]._dialogues.Array.data[3]._content
      value: The situation does not magically disappear, but Luna understands that she does not have to deal with everything alone.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[71]._dialogues.Array.data[4]._content
      value: She opens Connect one final time and reviews her privacy settings.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[71]._dialogues.Array.data[5]._content
      value: I guess I have to be more careful about what I share.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[71]._dialogues.Array.data[6]._content
      value: Luna closes her laptop.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[71]._dialogues.Array.data[7]._content
      value: FADE OUT.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[72]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: NEUTRAL ENDING
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[72]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: Luna decides to take a break from Connect. She blocks some accounts and deletes a few posts, but never tells anyone what happened.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[72]._dialogues.Array.data[2]._content
      value: The situation becomes quieter, but she is still unsure about what information is out there.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[72]._dialogues.Array.data[3]._content
      value: She puts her phone away.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[72]._dialogues.Array.data[4]._content
      value: Maybe it'll all just go away.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[72]._dialogues.Array.data[5]._content
      value: FADE OUT.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[73]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: BAD ENDING
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[73]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: Luna continues using Connect without addressing what has happened.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[73]._dialogues.Array.data[2]._content
      value: More people share the posts, and strangers continue contacting her.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[73]._dialogues.Array.data[3]._content
      value: She becomes increasingly isolated and stops talking about what is happening at school and online.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[73]._dialogues.Array.data[4]._content
      value: Her phone keeps buzzing.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[73]._dialogues.Array.data[5]._content
      value: 'SFX: BZZZZ. BZZZZ. BZZZZ.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[73]._dialogues.Array.data[6]._content
      value: Luna turns it face down.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[73]._dialogues.Array.data[7]._content
      value: I wish I had never downloaded this.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[73]._dialogues.Array.data[8]._content
      value: FADE OUT.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[74]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: During lunch, Luna notices a group of students talking about a new social media platform called Connect.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[74]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: Have you downloaded Connect yet?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[74]._dialogues.Array.data[2]._content
      value: Yeah! It's so much better than the other apps.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[74]._dialogues.Array.data[3]._content
      value: You can post pictures, follow people, message anyone and join communities.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[75]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: What's Connect?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[75]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: You seriously haven't heard of it? Everyone's using it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[75]._dialogues.Array.data[2]._content
      value: One of the students shows Luna the app.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[75]._dialogues.Array.data[3]._content
      value: Look, you can make your own profile and find people with the same interests.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[76]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Hey Luna! Did you manage to finish reading chapter four? I barely slept trying to summarize it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[77]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: I really hope we don't have a pop quiz today. My brain is completely fried already.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[78]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: You should probably head over to your desk before the bell rings, Luna.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[79]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Phew, that lecture was intense! At least the pop quiz wasn't as brutal as I feared.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[80]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: I need to double-check my notes when I get home. Let me know if you want to compare answers later.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[81]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Finally done for the day! See you tomorrow, Luna.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[82]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Morning Luna! Did you do anything fun yesterday, or was it just homework all night?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[83]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: I love your jacket today, by the way! It looks really nice on you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[84]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Hurry and take your seat before Mr. Henderson notices we're all chatting!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[85]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Class dragged on forever! Are you heading straight home or hanging around the plaza?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[86]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: I think a bunch of us might grab smoothies later. Catch you around, Luna!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[87]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Don't forget we have that group project coming up soon. Have a great afternoon, Luna!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[88]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Hey Luna... Man, track practice this morning completely wiped me out.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[89]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: If I start dozing off during the lecture, do me a favor and tap my shoulder, okay?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[90]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Class is starting any minute now. Let's get to our seats.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[91]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: We survived! I definitely need an energy drink or an afternoon nap right about now.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[92]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Gotta get ready for afternoon drills. Catch you later, Luna!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[93]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Enjoy the rest of your day, Luna. Don't stress too much over homework.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[94]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Hi Luna! I was just doodling in the margins of my notebook while waiting for the bell.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[95]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: I'm working on a new character design in my sketchbook. I'll show you once it's finished!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[96]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: We'd better put our art stuff away. The teacher is about to start.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[97]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: That history lecture actually inspired a new drawing idea for my portfolio!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[98]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: I'll probably spend the whole evening working on some new digital art.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[99]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Take care, Luna! See you in class tomorrow.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[100]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Hey Luna! Did you see the new update that dropped last night? The graphics patch is insane.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[101]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: I brought my tablet today to test out a new coding plugin during study hall.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[102]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: The bell is about to ring, Luna. Best get to your desk before roll call.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[103]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Finally out of class! Time to head home and grind some ranks on my PC.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[104]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: If you get stuck on the science worksheet, just let me know and we can compare answers.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[105]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Later, Luna! Have a good rest of your day.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[106]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Good morning, Luna. Please make sure your desk is clear and you have your materials ready.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[107]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: We have quite a lot of material to cover today, so I expect everyone's full attention.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[108]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Take your seat at your desk, Luna. Class will begin shortly.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[109]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Class is dismissed for today. Please review chapters four and five before tomorrow's discussion.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[110]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Remember that safe online habits apply to school forums as well. Be mindful of what you share.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[111]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Have a productive afternoon, Luna. Don't leave your assignments until the last minute.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[0]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._speakerName
      value: Connect
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[0]._options.Array.data[0].eventToPublish
      value: Choice1_Safe
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[0]._options.Array.data[1].eventToPublish
      value: Choice1_Neutral
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[0]._options.Array.data[2].eventToPublish
      value: Choice1_Risky
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
